@startuml
!include _yunlink_protocol_theme.iuml
title Yunlink Test World Map - Current Bridge Result Boundary

[*] --> RuntimeGate

RuntimeGate --> FailedSession : no active session
RuntimeGate --> FailedTarget : wrong target / scope
RuntimeGate --> FailedTtl : TTL expired
RuntimeGate --> FailedAuthority : no authority / stale lease
RuntimeGate --> AutoResult : gate passed

AutoResult --> RuntimeSucceeded : immediate runtime-auto-result
AutoResult --> PublishRos : typed bridge callback

PublishRos --> DiagnosticWarning : no ROS subscribers
PublishRos --> RosAccepted : ROS publish called
RosAccepted --> ExecutionSnapshot : Sunray publishes execution status

FailedSession --> [*]
FailedTarget --> [*]
FailedTtl --> [*]
FailedAuthority --> [*]
RuntimeSucceeded --> [*]
DiagnosticWarning --> [*]
ExecutionSnapshot --> [*]

state FailedSession <<Risk>>
state FailedTarget <<Risk>>
state FailedTtl <<Risk>>
state FailedAuthority <<Risk>>
state DiagnosticWarning <<Risk>>
state RuntimeSucceeded <<Transit>>
state RosAccepted <<Transit>>
state ExecutionSnapshot <<StatePlane>>

note right of RuntimeSucceeded
当前 auto-result 不代表飞行动作成功。
end note

note right of ExecutionSnapshot
当前 snapshot 与原 command correlation 未关联。
end note
@enduml
